WEBVTT

00:01.880 --> 00:05.160
Notify the entire army burn the granaries.

00:06.880 --> 00:08.280
Abandon the city.

00:10.400 --> 00:11.800
Retreat from the south.

00:11.880 --> 00:13.280
Yes.

00:14.320 --> 00:15.720
Let's go.

00:24.880 --> 00:26.280
Bring torches.

01:17.720 --> 01:22.640
You abandon Yiyang retreating to the rear with a thousand remnants.

01:23.400 --> 01:26.480
Soon after Wuyang also declared an emergency.

01:27.360 --> 01:32.520
Supply routes cut Zu Kun could only abandon this northern expedition.

01:39.000 --> 01:44.520
Months later you return to your residence however because of the failed northern expedition.

01:44.640 --> 01:47.880
You completely lost Your standing in court.

01:48.840 --> 01:54.000
Under Prince of Ning and the Chen family's constant schemes you eventually made a grave mistake.

01:54.120 --> 01:59.200
And were demoted to commoner by the emperor exiled to the Eastern Sea.

